Usage:
------

quartus_pfg [-h | --help[=<option|topic>] | -v]
quartus_pfg -c [options or option file] <input file> <output file> [secondary output file(s)]
quartus_pfg -c <settings file (.pfg)>
quartus_pfg --list
quartus_pfg --helper_image [options or option file] <output file>


Options:
--------

	-?
	-f <argument file>
	-h
	-c | --convert
	-i | --info
	-l | --list
	-o <value> | --option=<value>
	--ccert
	--check_integrity
	--compare
	--dni
	--help[=<option|topic>]
	--helper_image
	--lower_priority
	--provision_image
	--save=<filename>
	--xcorim

Help Topics:
------------

	arguments
	return_codes

For more information on specific options, use --help=<option|topic>.

